id: pm-4oc353
title: Text refusals drop the specific What happened detail when an echoed argv overflows the diagnostic ceiling
description: "The JSON diagnostic projection walks the declared ladder (full, omit_explanation, limit_collections, compact_recovery, action_only), but the human text path jumped straight from full to action_only. A refusal whose recovery bundle echoed a long attempted command (for example a 400-word --description) therefore printed only the generic title, the generic What is required line and an overflow notice, and dropped the one sentence that said what was wrong. Reproduced on 2026.10.30 with strict create plus --unset assignee: the short invocation names the problem, the long one does not. The same refusal also claimed --clear-* directives cannot satisfy required options, while repeatable options such as --clear-deps do satisfy them."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,diagnostics,output-budget
created_at: "2026-10-30T23:41:34.002Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-30T23:42:57.819Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-30T23:42:57.794Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-30T23:42:57.794Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: A text refusal whose full rendering exceeds the error text ceiling keeps the What happened detail and the missing flags whenever a ladder stage fits; it drops the attempted_command echo before the detail; it names the omission and points to --json; an oversized detail is bounded rather than removed; short refusals are byte-identical; the strict create refusal states the scalar/repeatable rule accurately; regression tests fail without the fix
parent: pm-5t33or
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: "renderBoundedGuidanceMessage compacts Why, collections and the recovery echo before falling back to action-only, bounds an oversized detail, and names the omission; strict create states the scalar/repeatable clear rule accurately."
expected_result: Agents reading text refusals see what was wrong even when their own long input overflows the diagnostic ceiling.
actual_result: "The 2026.10.30 reproduction (strict create, 400-word --description, --unset assignee) now prints What happened, missing: --assignee and the omission notice within 768 tokens; the two regression tests fail without the fix; short refusals are unchanged (875 CLI and diagnostic tests pass)."
