close_reason: Text refusals walk the declared diagnostic ladder and keep the specific detail
escape_class: production_defect
gate_evidence:
  disposition: gate_added
  owner: pm-4oc353
  gate_id: tests/unit/cli/error-guidance.spec.ts text ladder regressions
  negative_control: "Point formatPmCliErrorForDisplay and formatCommanderErrorForDisplay back at renderGuidanceMessage: both new tests fail (2 failed, 54 passed)"
  local_checks[5]: error-guidance spec 56/56,CLI unit and diagnostic integration suites 875/875,typecheck,eslint,built CLI reproduces the long strict-create refusal with What happened retained
  hosted_checks[2]: CI / Gates (static),CI / Gates (coverage)
body: "Fix in src/cli/error-guidance.ts: renderBoundedGuidanceMessage renders progressively compacted candidates following the declared ladder (drop Why, limit collections, compact the recovery bundle to suggested_retry under 400 bytes plus missing/allowed values/next_best_command, then bound the What happened text to 320 code points) and appends an omission notice; only text that still overflows falls through to the SDK action-only projection. The public projectPmDiagnosticText contract is unchanged. src/sdk/lifecycle/create.ts now says --unset cannot satisfy a required scalar option and that only repeatable options accept an explicit --clear-* empty set."
